  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square oil painting of pastel houses with stacked chimney caps and wide brims, with small horned creatures sitting around them under a deep blue sky, signed crump 11.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, signed crump 11 at lower right. Houses with rounded teal, purple and pink bodies, arched windows, flat purple brims like hats and stacked red and pink chimney caps stand on a turquoise ground under a flat deep blue sky. Small creatures with single eyes and horns, in orange, lime, teal and pink, sit among the houses, one at far left with a hat shaped house on its back. Thick black outlines, flat colour.",
    "impression": "A town of mushroom houses and the small creatures who live under them, with the deep blue sky making it feel like early evening. The stacked chimney caps look like layered cakes. Cosy and contained, a snow globe of a village.",
